  id: act6_missing
  title: "\u7B2C\u516D\u5E55 \xB7 \u7F3A\u9875"
  context: "2026-11-02 返回改稿；见 doc/performance-edit。"
  testOnly: 0
  initialVisitor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a00ade9d6e452c4ba72f85697a011c7, type: 2}
  arrivalSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a90926b1834a5135a7889bc8801033ca, type: 3}
  closeShutterOnComplete: 1
  arrivalDelay: 0.54485416
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a00ade9d6e452c4ba72f85697a011c7, type: 2}
    text: "卢卡，你把我给你的信交上去了吗？"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "我最后烧掉了。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a00ade9d6e452c4ba72f85697a011c7, type: 2}
    text: "为什么？"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "看到那些东西，你绝对走不了了，行会以后的事情也不好处理。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a00ade9d6e452c4ba72f85697a011c7, type: 2}
    text: "……"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a00ade9d6e452c4ba72f85697a011c7, type: 2}
    text: "我知道了，剩下的事我会自己说的。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99e1ffdb51533854ea9cf197f5a21f35, type: 2}
    text: "手续已经办完了，卢卡，我来给你开门。"
